  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Development: Integrated Rural Development Project of the Mountain Areas in the Oriental Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#xbf;s general objective is to sustainably improve the living conditions of rural communities in the mountain areas of the Oriental region and reduce their vulnerability to climate change. Its development objective is to increase the income of rural households and improve the living conditions of rural communities by improving agricultural production, diversifying income sources, adding value to  products and marketing.</narrative>
  </description>
